nnectionHostKey" variant="outline" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(connectionKeyScanning||!connectionForm.endpoint)||(connectionKeyScanning)"><Spinner v-if="connectionKeyScanning"/>{{connectionKeyScanning?'获取中…':'获取指纹'}}</Button></div><small class="help">平台主动读取服务器公钥；确认后严格校验，不会关闭 StrictHostKeyChecking。</small><div v-if="pendingConnectionHostKey" class="fingerprint-confirm"><b>确认 Git 服务器身份</b><dl><div><dt>目标</dt><dd><code>{{pendingConnectionHostKey.addr}}</code></dd></div><div><dt>算法</dt><dd><code>{{pendingConnectionHostKey.algorithm}}</code></dd></div><div><dt>SHA256 指纹</dt><dd><code>{{pendingConnectionHostKey.fingerprint}}</code></dd></div></dl><p>请与云效或服务器管理员公布的 SSH 指纹核对。确认后，该连接只信任这把服务器公钥。</p><div><Button @click="pendingConnectionHostKey=null" variant="outline" size="sm" type="button">取消</Button><Button @click="acceptConnectionHostKey" variant="default" size="sm" type="button">确认并使用</Button></div></div><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.ssh_fingerprint']">{{_validationErrors['config.ssh_fingerprint'].message}}</FieldError></Field></template><div v-else class="two"><Field data-resource-field="username" data-validation-field="username" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['username']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['username']"><FieldLabel>{{connectionForm.kind==='aliyun-sae'?'AccessKey ID':connectionForm.kind==='git'?'用户名 / 邮箱':'用户名'}}</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.username" placeholder="留空保留"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['username']">{{_validationErrors['username'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="password" data-validation-field="password" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['password']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['password']"><FieldLabel>{{connectionForm.kind==='aliyun-sae'?'AccessKey Secret':connectionForm.kind==='git'?'个人访问令牌（PAT）':'密码 / Token'}}</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.password" type="password" placeholder="留空保留"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['password']">{{_validationErrors['password'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><small v-if="connectionForm.kind==='git'&&gitAuthMode==='https'" class="help">HTTPS 模式填写代码托管账号与个人访问令牌（PAT），不会读取本机 SSH 私钥。</small></TabsContent><TabsContent :disabled="!connectionHasParameters" :value="&quot;parameters&quot;" force-mount v-show="!(connectionEditorTab!==&quot;parameters&quot;)" class="min-w-0"><template v-if="connectionForm.kind==='mysql'"><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.tls" data-validation-field="config.tls" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.tls']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.tls']"><FieldLabel>连接加密</FieldLabel><OptionPicker v-model="connectionForm.config.tls" :options="[{value:'true',label:'TLS（校验证书）'},{value:'false',label:'内网明文连接'}]" width="100%"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.tls']">{{_validationErrors['config.tls'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><small class="help">连接只配置 MySQL 实例与账号，具体数据库在应用环境资源绑定时选择。连接测试只验证实例认证，不执行 SQL 变更。</small></template><template v-if="connectionForm.kind==='redis'"><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.db" data-validation-field="config.db" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.db']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.db']"><FieldLabel>Redis DB</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.db" placeholder="0"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.db']">{{_validationErrors['config.db'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="config.key_prefix" data-validation-field="config.key_prefix" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.key_prefix']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.key_prefix']"><FieldLabel>允许操作的 Key 前缀（每行一个）</FieldLabel><Textarea v-model="redisPrefixText" placeholder="menu:&#10;cache:orders:" rows="3"/><FieldDescription>最多 20 个精确前缀，不允许空值或通配符；保存不会执行 Redis 命令。</FieldDescription><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.key_prefix']">{{_validationErrors['config.key_prefix'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.redis_auth" data-validation-field="config.redis_auth" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.redis_auth']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.redis_auth']"><FieldLabel>Redis 认证</FieldLabel><OptionPicker v-model="connectionForm.config.redis_auth" :options="[{value:'password',label:'密码 / ACL 用户密码'},{value:'none',label:'无认证（仅可信内网）'}]" width="100%"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.redis_auth']">{{_validationErrors['config.redis_auth'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="config.tls" data-validation-field="config.tls" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.tls']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.tls']"><FieldLabel>Redis 连接加密</FieldLabel><OptionPicker v-model="connectionForm.config.tls" :options="[{value:'true',label:'TLS（校验证书）'},{value:'false',label:'内网明文'}]" width="100%"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.tls']">{{_validationErrors['config.tls'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><p class="help">云 Redis 标准代理与自建单机使用同一协议；用户名可留空或填写 ACL 用户。必须配置精确 Key 前缀；每个环境独立连接。仅支持单地址或标准代理，不自动处理原生 Cluster/Sentinel。测试只认证、选择 DB 和 PING，不证明写权限。公网须有网络连通、白名单及 TLS。</p></template><template v-if="connectionForm.kind==='nacos'"><p class="help">服务地址填写完整根路径，例如 http://host:8848/nacos；本阶段适配 2.4/2.5，不支持 3.x 或阿里云 MSE 专用鉴权。</p><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.nacos_version" data-validation-field="config.nacos_version" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.nacos_version']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.nacos_version']"><FieldLabel>Nacos 版本</FieldLabel><OptionPicker v-model="connectionForm.config.nacos_version" :options="['2.4','2.5']" width="100%"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.nacos_version']">{{_validationErrors['config.nacos_version'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="config.nacos_auth" data-validation-field="config.nacos_auth" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.nacos_auth']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.nacos_auth']"><FieldLabel>Nacos 认证</FieldLabel><OptionPicker v-model="connectionForm.config.nacos_auth" :options="[{value:'password',label:'账号密码（自动登录）'},{value:'token',label:'已有 Token（填在密码字段）'},{value:'none',label:'无认证（仅可信内网）'}]" width="100%"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.nacos_auth']">{{_validationErrors['config.nacos_auth'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><Field data-resource-field="config.namespace" data-validation-field="config.namespace" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.namespace']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.namespace']"><FieldLabel>命名空间 ID</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.namespace" placeholder="留空为 public，其他空间填写 ID 而不是名称"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.namespace']">{{_validationErrors['config.namespace'].message}}</FieldError></Field><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.test_data_id" data-validation-field="config.test_data_id" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.test_data_id']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.test_data_id']"><FieldLabel>测试 Data ID</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.test_data_id" placeholder="例如 application.yaml（仅用于只读连接测试）"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.test_data_id']">{{_validationErrors['config.test_data_id'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="config.test_group" data-validation-field="config.test_group" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.test_group']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.test_group']"><FieldLabel>测试 Group</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.test_group"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.test_group']">{{_validationErrors['config.test_group'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><small class="help">连接测试不发布配置；发布权限在受审核执行时验证。每个环境独立配置连接，建议 HTTPS 和最小权限账号。</small></template><template v-if="connectionForm.kind==='zentao'"><Field data-resource-field="config.product_ids" data-validation-field="config.product_ids" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.product_ids']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.product_ids']"><FieldLabel>允许查询的 Bug 产品 ID（逗号分隔）</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.product_ids" placeholder="1,2；仅同步人员可留空"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.product_ids']">{{_validationErrors['config.product_ids'].message}}</FieldError></Field><small class="help">研发工作台实时查询来源 Bug，不再全量同步或设置同步周期；状态、人员和排序在查询页面选择。公共凭据仅用于读取，本人写操作需单独验证本人账号。人员同步入口在成员管理，只同步账号和姓名、不含密码，需要组织/用户列表查看权限；地址须包含实际安装子路径。</small></template><template v-if="connectionForm.kind==='maven'"><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.repository_id" data-validation-field="config.repository_id" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.repository_id']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.repository_id']"><FieldLabel>仓库 ID</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.repository_id" placeholder="默认使用连接名称"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.repository_id']">{{_validationErrors['config.repository_id'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="config.mirror_of" data-validation-field="config.mirror_of" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.mirror_of']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.mirror_of']"><FieldLabel>mirrorOf</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.mirror_of" placeholder="*"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.mirror_of']">{{_validationErrors['config.mirror_of'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><Field data-resource-field="config.settings_path" data-validation-field="config.settings_path" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.settings_path']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.settings_path']"><FieldLabel>已有 settings.xml（可选）</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.settings_path" placeholder="留空由平台安全生成"/><small class="help">留空时自动生成引用环境变量的 settings.xml，不把密码写入文件。</small><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.settings_path']">{{_validationErrors['config.settings_path'].message}}</FieldError></Field></template><template v-if="connectionForm.kind==='aliyun-sae'"><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.region" data-validation-field="config.region" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.region']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.region']"><FieldLabel>地域</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.region" placeholder="cn-hangzhou"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.region']">{{_validationErrors['config.region'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="endpoint" data-validation-field="endpoint" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['endpoint']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['endpoint']"><FieldLabel>SAE Endpoint（可选）</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.endpoint" placeholder="留空自动生成"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['endpoint']">{{_validationErrors['endpoint'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><div class="two"><Field data-resource-field="config.oss_bucket" data-validation-field="config.oss_bucket" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.oss_bucket']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.oss_bucket']"><FieldLabel>OSS Bucket（JAR 必填）</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.oss_bucket"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.oss_bucket']">{{_validationErrors['config.oss_bucket'].message}}</FieldError></Field><Field data-resource-field="config.oss_endpoint" data-validation-field="config.oss_endpoint" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.oss_endpoint']" @vue:mounted="delete _validationErrors['config.oss_endpoint']"><FieldLabel>OSS Endpoint（可选）</FieldLabel><Input v-model="connectionForm.config.oss_endpoint" placeholder="留空按地域生成"/><FieldError v-if="_validationErrors['config.oss_endpoint']">{{_validationErrors['config.oss_endpoint'].message}}</FieldError></Field></div><Field data-resource-field="config.oss_prefix" data-validation-field="config.oss_prefix" :data-invalid="!!_validationErrors['config.oss_prefix']